<title>USA: BOXING-TRINIDAD RETAINS IBF WELTERWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-TRINIDAD RETAINS IBF WELTERWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tennessee 1997-01-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Felix Trinidad of Puerto Rico retained his International Boxing Federation welterweight title on Saturday when the referee stopped the fight with Kevin Lueshing of Britain at 2:59 of the third round.</p>
</text>
